
# AWS 3-Tier Architecture on AWS

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of a complete AWS 3-Tier Architecture using Amazon S3, EC2, Aurora MySQL, Application Load Balancer, Auto Scaling Group, and CloudWatch.

## Architecture Diagram

<img width="1226" height="555" alt="Architecture"
src="YOUR_ARCHITECTURE_IMAGE_LINK"/>

---

## Architecture Flow

User
↓
S3 Static Website
↓
Application Load Balancer
↓
EC2 Auto Scaling Group
↓
Aurora MySQL Database

---

## AWS Services Used

- Amazon VPC
- Public & Private Subnets
- Internet Gateway
- NAT Gateway
- Security Groups
- S3 Static Website Hosting
- EC2
- Launch Template
- Auto Scaling Group
- Application Load Balancer
- Aurora MySQL
- CloudWatch

---

